<BaseLayout title="Website Terms" description="Terms for using the Scottish Energy Services website.">
  <section class="section"><div class="container legal-copy"><h1 class="section-title">Website Terms</h1><p>Last updated: 6 October 2026.</p><h2>Using this website</h2><p>This website provides information about Scottish Energy Services and a way to enquire about our services. Please use it lawfully and do not interfere with its operation, attempt unauthorised access or submit abusive or misleading material.</p><h2>Information and quotations</h2><p>Website information is general guidance. Assessment requirements depend on the building, location and circumstances. Contact us to confirm the scope relevant to your project. An enquiry does not form a service contract; scope, fees and engagement terms are confirmed separately.</p><h2>Website content</h2><p>Site content and media are protected by applicable intellectual-property rights. You may view and use information for your own project enquiries. Obtain permission before reproducing material beyond uses permitted by law. Links to third-party websites are provided for reference; their content and policies are their responsibility.</p><h2>Availability and your rights</h2><p>We aim to keep information accurate and the website available but cannot guarantee uninterrupted access. Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limits your statutory rights. These website terms do not replace the terms agreed for professional services.</p><h2>Privacy and contact</h2><p>See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>. For website questions contact <a href="mailto:info@scottishenergyservices.co.uk">info@scottishenergyservices.co.uk</a> or call <a href="tel:01412551360">0141 255 1360</a>.</p>
